This product includes address map data (the files under data/maps/) derived
from the HunterPie project, Copyright the HunterPie contributors, licensed
under the Apache License, Version 2.0:

    https://github.com/HunterPie/HunterPie

The .map files are plain-text tables of static addresses and pointer offsets
that HunterPie obtained through reverse engineering of Monster Hunter: World,
Monster Hunter Rise and Monster Hunter Wilds. They are redistributed here
unmodified.

No source code from HunterPie is included; the Rust implementation in this
repository was written independently against the observed memory layout.
